classDiagram
%% CDB Finance — Backend: como VSA + Hexagonal se materializam em classes.
%% Fatia vertical exemplar: f006 (transactions/transfer) sobre o contexto monetary.
%% Toda fatia fNNN repete este formato (_2_infrastructure/_1_application/_0_domain);
%% troque "Transaction"/f006 pelo agregado/numero da fatia.
    direction LR

    class TransactionResource {
        <<f006 _2_infrastructure Resource CDI>>
        so traducao de formato
        +create(userId, TransactionRequest) Response
        +patchStatus(userId, PatchStatusRequest) Response
    }
    class TransactionRequest {
        <<f006 _2_infrastructure DTO record>>
    }
    class FeatureTransactionUseCase {
        <<f006 _1_application UseCase CDI>>
        nome real: TransactionUseCase (colide com o do contexto -\nreferenciado por FQN, sem import, no proprio codigo)
        orquestra contexto + servicos da propria fatia
        +createTransaction(userId, Command, categoryId) Result
        +deleteTransaction(txId, scope) Result
    }
    class ClosingService {
        <<f000 _1_application Policy - fatia-base>>
        +validateDate(userId, date) Result
    }
    class TransactionCategoryLink {
        <<f006 F005_TRANSACTION_CATEGORY>>
        vinculo transacao-categoria; Transaction.categoryId
    }
    class TransactionsDeleted {
        <<f006 _0_domain event>>
        publicado apos delete; f004 reage best-effort
    }
    class ContextBridge {
        <<CDI core - costura CDI/Registry>>
        registra portas no Registry no StartupEvent
    }
    class MonetaryUseCases {
        <<Facade do contexto>>
        +ucTransaction()$ TransactionUseCase
        +ucAccount()$ AccountUseCase
    }
    class ContextTransactionUseCase {
        <<context _1_application UseCase>>
        nome real: TransactionUseCase (br.cdb.context.monetary...)
        +execute(Command) Result
    }
    class TransactionService {
        <<Service aplicacao>>
        parametros simples, valida dominio
    }
    class MonetaryTransaction {
        <<Domain Model record>>
    }
    class TransactionRepository {
        <<Porta interface dominio>>
        +save(MonetaryTransaction) Result
    }
    class TransactionJDBCRepository {
        <<Adaptador infra JDBC-H2 - contexto>>
    }
    class Registry {
        <<Service Locator commons>>
    }
    class Result {
        <<Success ou Failure>>
        +map()
        +flatMap()
        +recover()
        +get()
    }

    TransactionResource ..> TransactionRequest : recebe DTO
    TransactionResource ..> FeatureTransactionUseCase : delega TODA a orquestracao
    TransactionResource ..> Result : traduz em HTTP na borda
    FeatureTransactionUseCase ..> ClosingService : politica validada na FRONTEIRA da feature - base f000
    FeatureTransactionUseCase ..> TransactionCategoryLink : resolve categoria via saveCategory/withCategory
    FeatureTransactionUseCase ..> TransactionsDeleted : publica no MessageBus pos-delete
    FeatureTransactionUseCase ..> MonetaryUseCases : use case do contexto via acessor estatico
    MonetaryUseCases ..> ContextTransactionUseCase : resolve no Registry - tryGet
    ContextTransactionUseCase ..> TransactionService : orquestra
    ContextTransactionUseCase ..> Result : retorna
    TransactionService ..> TransactionRepository : usa a PORTA
    TransactionService ..> MonetaryTransaction : opera o modelo
    TransactionRepository <|.. TransactionJDBCRepository : adaptador implementa
    ContextBridge ..> Registry : liga porta ao adaptador no startup

    note for TransactionResource "VSA: o Resource so traduz formato.\nOrquestracao mora no UseCase da propria fatia\n(fNNN/_1_application), nunca num god-object central."
    note for MonetaryUseCases "Hexagonal: contexto livre de framework.\nDI via Registry, nunca CDI/Spring.\nFacade expoe os use cases (estatico)."
    note for Result "Railway: sem excecao para fluxo de negocio.\nErro de dominio e objeto de valor."
